<title>USA: Kmart declines comment on takeover talk.</title>
<headline>Kmart declines comment on takeover talk.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kmart Corp declined to comment Tuesday on market rumors the discount store giant is in takeover talks with Kohlberg Kravis &amp; Roberts.</p>
<p>&quot;It's just a rumor,&quot; said Kmart spokeswoman Shawn Kahle. &quot;We're not going to comment on it.&quot;</p>
<p>Troy, Mich.-based Kmart's shares were up 15 percent, or 1-1/2, to 11-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange where Kmart was the largest volume stock.</p>
</text>
